{"type":"text","timestamp":1790361260464,"sessionID":"ses_f26291117ffeThBVdMkUhVg3rY","part":{"id":"prt_0d9d8d197001ryi6hzPsyCsX6b","messageID":"msg_0d9d88a20001fsxPrAJBrGr3Z0","sessionID":"ses_f26291117ffeThBVdMkUhVg3rY","type":"text","text":"Godot loads the scene successfully, and the render confirms the blue styling and larger text. I’m checking the reserved portrait area with one of the existing portrait assets and previewing the focused response state.","time":{"start":1790361260439,"end":1790361260443},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0d9b8a4bb4225c7f016ab6bea9de5c87d0a50799caa84110c6","phase":"commentary"}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790361260464,"sessionID":"ses_f26291117ffeThBVdMkUhVg3rY","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_Kp6rB3bbFaBIOmcq4Arcm63t","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Add File: /workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tpreview.call_deferred()\n+\n+func preview() -> void:\n+\tvar scene = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\troot.add_child(scene)\n+\tvar balloon = scene.get_node(\"PortraitBalloon\")\n+\tvar portrait = balloon.get_node(\"%PortraitTexture\")\n+\tportrait.texture = load(\"res://assets/portraits/hero.png\")\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tvar row = portrait.get_parent()\n+\tvar text = row.get_node(\"VBoxContainer\")\n+\tassert(portrait.size.x >= 150 and portrait.size.y >= 150)\n+\tassert(portrait.position.x == text.position.x + text.size.x + 30)\n+\tassert(row.get_theme_constant(\"separation\") == 30)\n+\tassert(portrait.get_theme_default_font_size() == 26)\n+\tvar margin = row.get_parent()\n+\tfor side in [\"left\", \"right\", \"top\", \"bottom\"]:\n+\t\tassert(margin.get_theme_constant(\"margin_\" + side) == 30)\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\troot.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/portrait_preview.png\")\n+\tballoon.get_node(\"Balloon/ResponsesMenu/ResponseExample\").grab_focus()\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\troot.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/portrait_focus_preview.png\")\n+\tprint(\"Verified portrait dimensions, right-side order, spacing, font size, and margins.\")\n+\tquit()\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd\n+++ /workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tpreview.call_deferred()\n+\n+func preview() -> void:\n+\tvar scene = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\troot.add_child(scene)\n+\tvar balloon = scene.get_node(\"PortraitBalloon\")\n+\tvar portrait = balloon.get_node(\"%PortraitTexture\")\n+\tportrait.texture = load(\"res://assets/portraits/hero.png\")\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tvar row = portrait.get_parent()\n+\tvar text = row.get_node(\"VBoxContainer\")\n+\tassert(portrait.size.x >= 150 and portrait.size.y >= 150)\n+\tassert(portrait.position.x == text.position.x + text.size.x + 30)\n+\tassert(row.get_theme_constant(\"separation\") == 30)\n+\tassert(portrait.get_theme_default_font_size() == 26)\n+\tvar margin = row.get_parent()\n+\tfor side in [\"left\", \"right\", \"top\", \"bottom\"]:\n+\t\tassert(margin.get_theme_constant(\"margin_\" + side) == 30)\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\troot.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/portrait_preview.png\")\n+\tballoon.get_node(\"Balloon/ResponsesMenu/ResponseExample\").grab_focus()\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\troot.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/portrait_focus_preview.png\")\n+\tprint(\"Verified portrait dimensions, right-side order, spacing, font size, and margins.\")\n+\tquit()\n\n","files":[{"filePath":"/workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd","relativePath":"workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd","type":"add","patch":"Index: /workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd\n+++ /workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd\n@@ -0,0 +1,30 @@\n+extends SceneTree\n+\n+func _initialize() -> void:\n+\tpreview.call_deferred()\n+\n+func preview() -> void:\n+\tvar scene = load(\"res://scenes/main.tscn\").instantiate()\n+\troot.add_child(scene)\n+\tvar balloon = scene.get_node(\"PortraitBalloon\")\n+\tvar portrait = balloon.get_node(\"%PortraitTexture\")\n+\tportrait.texture = load(\"res://assets/portraits/hero.png\")\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tvar row = portrait.get_parent()\n+\tvar text = row.get_node(\"VBoxContainer\")\n+\tassert(portrait.size.x >= 150 and portrait.size.y >= 150)\n+\tassert(portrait.position.x == text.position.x + text.size.x + 30)\n+\tassert(row.get_theme_constant(\"separation\") == 30)\n+\tassert(portrait.get_theme_default_font_size() == 26)\n+\tvar margin = row.get_parent()\n+\tfor side in [\"left\", \"right\", \"top\", \"bottom\"]:\n+\t\tassert(margin.get_theme_constant(\"margin_\" + side) == 30)\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\troot.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/portrait_preview.png\")\n+\tballoon.get_node(\"Balloon/ResponsesMenu/ResponseExample\").grab_focus()\n+\tawait process_frame\n+\tawait RenderingServer.frame_post_draw\n+\troot.get_texture().get_image().save_png(\"res://.godot/portrait_focus_preview.png\")\n+\tprint(\"Verified portrait dimensions, right-side order, spacing, font size, and margins.\")\n+\tquit()\n","additions":30,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA workspace/.godot/verify_portrait.gd","time":{"start":1790361260451,"end":1790361260455}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0d9b8a4bb4225c7f016ab6beaa6f3c87d08c612eadf8843152"}},"id":"prt_0d9d8d19d001BxXpU9L3loUjsL","sessionID":"ses_f26291117ffeThBVdMkUhVg3rY","messageID":"msg_0d9d88a20001fsxPrAJBrGr3Z0"}}
